ferrovgl
Copyright (c) 2026 ferrovgl contributors

ferrovgl is an independent reimplementation in Rust of the architecture and
algorithms of LVGL v9.6.0 (https://lvgl.io, https://github.com/lvgl/lvgl).
No C source code from LVGL is compiled into or linked by ferrovgl. Source files
that are ports of specific upstream files name the upstream path in a header
comment ("Ported from lvgl v9.6.0: <path>").

