Fonts
-----

The bundled font data (crates/ferrovgl-fonts/data/*.lvfnt) is converted from
the glyph tables shipped with LVGL and is not covered by the ferrovgl code
licence alone; the ferrovgl-fonts package declares
"(MIT OR Apache-2.0) AND OFL-1.1 AND Bitstream-Vera":

* Montserrat and Font Awesome 5 Free (the LVGL symbol glyphs): SIL Open Font
  License 1.1, with both copyright notices, in crates/ferrovgl-fonts/OFL.txt.
* DejaVu Sans: Bitstream Vera Fonts licence and Arev Fonts licence (DejaVu
  changes in the public domain), in crates/ferrovgl-fonts/LICENSE-DejaVu.txt.
* UNSCII: public domain.

Provenance is recorded in crates/ferrovgl-fonts/data/SOURCE.md.

The 48x48 LVGL logo bitmap in ferrovgl-examples
(src/assets/img_example_lvgl_logo.rs) is reproduced unmodified from LVGL's
MIT-licensed examples/assets/img_example_lvgl_logo.c; see TRADEMARK.md.

